source: crates/sb/tests/logs_docker.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8_lossy(&help.get_output().stdout)"
---
  Shows Saltbox's systemd services and Docker containers, and the log of the one you choose, starting with the Docker containers.

  USAGE

    sb docker logs [--flags]

  FLAGS

    --color    Controls when to use color (auto)
    -h --help  Help for logs
